# Loose list
- a

- b
  - b1

  - b2 is b1's sibling after a blank line

# Orphans
  - orphan at depth 1 is read as depth 0
- x
    - skipping a level is an orphan too

# Numbering
+ one
  + nested one
  + nested two
+ two
  + nested again starts at one
- unordered items don't count
+ three
7. seven
+ eight

text ends the list

+ one again
99999999999999999999999. saturates
+ stays saturated
